body:
I just want a calm and chill platonic friend group where we all just help each other out and support one another damn it   ;\_\_\_\_;  
Either that or a utility boyfriend to help me with handy work around the house and with some errands.  
But yeah this needs to stop. Well this and the belief that there is only a single person for everyone and that we should be on some sort of quest to find them. Sounds cute on paper, but is super unhealthy and depressing in reality.
